WEBVTT

1
00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.160
Once upon a time...

2
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.118
in a happy forest,
in the happiest tree...

3
00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:58.758
lived the happiest creatures
the world has ever known.

4
00:00:58.920 --> 00:00:59.920
The Trolls.

5
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:03.392
They loved nothing more

6
00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:05.948
than to sing,
and dance, and hug.

7
00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.634
Dance, and hug,
and sing, and dance,

8
00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:09.960
and sing, and hug,
and dance...

9
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.096
and hug, and dance,
and sing, and hug,

10
00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:12.120
and dance, and hug...

11
00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:15.833
But then one day,

12
00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.478
the Trolls
were discovered by...

13
00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.113
a Bergen!

14
00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.232
The Bergens
didn't know how to sing...

15
00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.992
or dance...

16
00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.678
or even hug.

17
00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.759
They were the most miserable
creatures in all the land.

18
00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:32.155
And once they saw
how happy the Trolls were...

19
00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.920
they wanted some of that
happiness for themselves.

20
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.956
Oh, my God!

21
00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:43.033
Eating a Troll
made them feel so happy...

22
00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.111
they started a tradition.

23
00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:47.350
Once a year, every year...

24
00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.875
the Bergens would gather
around the Troll Tree...

25
00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.871
to taste happiness...

26
00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.032
on a holiday they called...

27
00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:56.349
Trollstice.

28
00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:12.800
Whoo!

29
00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:15.678
Good morning, Daddy!

30
00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.400
Daddy, wake up!

31
00:02:17.560 --> 00:02:20.313
Daddy, wake up!
Wake up! Wake up, Daddy!

32
00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:23.355
Wake up, Daddy.

33
00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:25.670
Daddy! Daddy!
Daddy! Daddy!

34
00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:26.875
Daddy, wake up!

35
00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:30.391
Gristle! What time is it?

36
00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:33.996
It's Trollstice!

37
00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:38.074
Trollstice!
Our one day to be happy.

38
00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.240
Yeah!

39
00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.709
Trolls! Trolls! Trolls!

40
00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:45.151
Trolls! Trolls! Trolls!

41
00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:53.194
Please give it up for
your Keeper of the Trolls...

42
00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.516
your Minister of Happiness...

43
00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.079
your Royal Chef...

44
00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.280
Me.

45
00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:01.440
Ooh!

46
00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:10.438
This is
a very special Trollstice...

47
00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:14.195
as there is one amongst us
who has never tasted a Troll.

48
00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.669
Ooh, me!
She is talking about me!

49
00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.677
Prince Gristle...

50
00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:20.597
...the time has come.

51
00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.800
It's okay, son.

52
00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:25.270
I remember being nervous
my first time.

53
00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:26.555
Okay.

54
00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.711
That's my boy.

55
00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:33.280
It is my sacred duty...

56
00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:37.399
to initiate you in the
ways of true happiness.

57
00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:44.559
I have chosen an extra-special
Troll, just for you.

58
00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:48.436
The happiest,
the most positive...

59
00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.798
sweetest Troll of all.

60
00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.798
And because every prince
deserves a princess...

61
00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:57.913
I give you the one
they call Princess Poppy.

62
00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:00.631
Please make me happy,
Princess Poppy.

63
00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:02.909
What are you feeling?

64
00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.955
That one's rotten!

65
00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:10.074
It's fake?

66
00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:12.151
Fake?
Fake?

67
00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.309
They're gone?

68
00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:17.432
Where are they?

69
00:04:17.600 --> 00:04:19.830
Don't worry, sire.
We'll find them.

70
00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:23.192
I think I hear something!

71
00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:26.193
Go! Go!

72
00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:28.040
We got Poppy!

73
00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.496
Pass her to me!
Here comes Poppy!

74
00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:30.669
Here she is!

75
00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.838
Ah! There's my princess.

76
00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.109
Da-da.

77
00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.954
King Peppy, some of the others
can't keep up.

78
00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:39.475
No Troll left behind!

79
00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.349
Thank you, King Peppy!

80
00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.016
- Thank you, King Peppy!
- Thank you!

81
00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:48.355
Thank you, King Peppy.

82
00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:51.717
No Troll left behind!

83
00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.199
Daddy, where are they?

84
00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.472
Don't just stand there!
Make my son happy!

85
00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:01.631
He will be happy!

86
00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:24.468
Where is he?

87
00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.594
I don't think
King Peppy made it.

88
00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:38.998
When I say
no Troll left behind...

89
00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:45.069
I mean,
no Troll left behind!

90
00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:50.559
King Peppy,
where's Princess Poppy?

91
00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.836
Don't worry. She's safe.

92
00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.434
No Troll left behind!

93
00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:56.839
Aww!

94
00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:57.960
But we'll be a lot safer

95
00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.256
the further we get
from Bergen Town.

96
00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.191
Go, go! Hurry!

97
00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:05.393
That's right! Take her away!

98
00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.198
Get her out of my sight!

99
00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:12.115
She is hereby banished
from Bergen Town forever.

100
00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.870
We can all be happy again.

101
00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.917
I'll find the Trolls!

102
00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:22.759
And shove them down
your ungrateful throats.

103
00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.317
But, Daddy...

104
00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:35.314
I never got to eat a Troll.

105
00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.873
What's gonna
make me happy now?

106
00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.120
Come here, son.

107
00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:46.989
Nothing.

108
00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:50.152
Absolutely nothing.

109
00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:54.677
You will never, ever, ever,
ever be happy.

110
00:06:55.440 --> 00:06:56.509
Never?

111
00:06:57.320 --> 00:06:58.320
Ever.

112
00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.513
Here! Right here!

113
00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:17.514
This is where we will
rebuild our civilization.

114
00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:21.513
It has everything we need.

115
00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:24.148
Fresh air,
clean water...

116
00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:26.675
and sweet acoustics.

117
00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:36.476
Ba de ya
Say do you remember

118
00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.355
Ba de ya
Dancing in September

119
00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:44.872
Ba de ya
Never was a cloudy day

120
00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:51.475
Twenty years ago today,
King Peppy made us safe...

121
00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:52.789
and now every Troll is free

122
00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:54.677
to be happy
and live in perfect...

123
00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:56.558
Harmony
Harmony

124
00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:58.073
Harmony

125
00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.356
And that's why
we hug every hour.

126
00:08:00.440 --> 00:08:01.440
Yep.

127
00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:03.317
I wish it was
every half hour.

128
00:08:03.480 --> 00:08:04.480
So do I.

129
00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:05.696
But that wouldn't leave
much time

130
00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:07.200
for singing and dancing,
now would it?

131
00:08:07.360 --> 00:08:10.511
Princess Poppy, do the Bergens
still want to eat us?

132
00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:12.477
You bet!

133
00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:15.233
But just because it's the only
way they'll ever be happy.

134
00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:18.312
Oh, no.
I do taste delicious.

135
00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:21.597
Isn't there anything else
to make them happy?

136
00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.512
Ooh. What about
having birthday parties?

137
00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:24.999
Or slumber parties?

138
00:08:25.160 --> 00:08:28.232
Or staring at your parents
while they sleep.

139
00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.072
But I don't want
to be food.

140
00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.999
Don't worry.
No Troll ever will be.

141
00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.679
And that's why
we're celebrating

142
00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.751
with the biggest party ever.

143
00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:39.876
Everybody's gonna be there.

144
00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:41.832
Everybody?

145
00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.515
Everybody.

146
00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:52.956
Everybody, move
your hair and feel united

147
00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:54.798
Ohh!

148
00:08:56.440 --> 00:09:00.911
Everybody, shake your
hair and feel united

149
00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.913
Ohh!

150
00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.600
Yeah

151
00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:07.896
Everybody's coming
to the celebration

152
00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:10.036
I'ma hook you up
with the invitation

153
00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:11.872
Let your hair swing
and party with me

154
00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.632
No bad vibes
Just love, you'll see

155
00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:17.874
Do the D-A-N-C-E
One-two-three-four fight

156
00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:20.793
Stick to the B-E-A-T
Get ready to

157
00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:21.960
Ignite

158
00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:26.073
You are such a P-Y-T
Catching all the lights

159
00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:29.789
Just easy as A-B-C
That's how you make it right

160
00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.960
It ain 't hard out here
When you're doing it right

161
00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.309
Put a smile on blast
That's the Troll life

162
00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:36.152
And I'm here
to help you through it

163
00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:38.475
Come on, Smidge,
I know you can do it

164
00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.148
Your confidence
gives me strength.

165
00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:50.358
Okay, Mr. Dinkles.

166
00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.158
Say, leaves!

167
00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:56.473
Mmm.
Something's missing.

168
00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:00.960
That's it!

169
00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.576
Don't stop, don't stop
Don't stop the beat

170
00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:06.352
I can't stop, can't stop
Can't stop the beat

171
00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.272
I won't stop, won't stop
Won't stop the beat

172
00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:09.475
Go!

173
00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:15.871
Everybody, shake your
hair and feel united

174
00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.872
Ohh!

175
00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:21.714
Sunshine day,
everybody's singing

176
00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:23.199
Sunshine day

177
00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:28.195
Everybody, move your
hair and feel united

178
00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:32.553
Ohh! Yeah, ohh!

179
00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.235
Yeah!

180
00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:47.874
Unbelievable, guys.

181
00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.991
Really, really great.
Good job.

182
00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:52.071
I could hear you
from a mile away!

183
00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:54.356
Good. I was worried we weren't
projecting enough.

184
00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:58.399
Poppy, if I can hear you,
so can the Bergens.

185
00:10:58.560 --> 00:10:59.560
Oh, boy.

186
00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:01.039
Here we go again.
Oh, Branch...

187
00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.394
You always ruin everything.

188
00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.039
Warning us
about the Bergens.

189
00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.600
No, I don't.

190
00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.750
The Bergens are coming!

191
00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:11.911
The Bergens are coming!

192
00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:14.911
The Bergens are coming!

193
00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:18.069
Come on! We haven't seen
a Bergen in 20 years.

194
00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.429
They're not gonna find us.

195
00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:21.352
No, they're not
going to find me,

196
00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:23.120
because I'll be
in my highly camouflaged...

197
00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.919
heavily fortified,
Bergen-proof survival bunker.

198
00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:27.896
You mean you're not coming
to the party tonight?

199
00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.520
But it's going to be
the biggest...

200
00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:30.600
The loudest...

201
00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:32.511
The craziest party ever!

202
00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.751
Big? Loud?

203
00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:36.960
Crazy?

204
00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:39.236
You're just gonna lead
the Bergens right to us!

205
00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.118
Are you sure
you wanna invite

206
00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:43.071
this party pooper
to poop on your party?

207
00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:45.959
Yes. I think everyone deserves
to be happy.

208
00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.394
I don't do happy.

209
00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.239
Branch, I know you have
happiness inside you.

210
00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.470
You just need
our help to find it.

211
00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:58.110
Celebrate
freedom from the Bergens

212
00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.911
What do you say, Branch?

213
00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.632
Oh, my God.

214
00:12:14.800 --> 00:12:17.155
I wouldn't be caught dead at
your party, but you will be.

215
00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.833
Caught and dead.

216
00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.069
Whoa, whoa.

217
00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:22.151
Easy, Branch. Easy.

218
00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:27.114
Thank you for providing
safe passage, brother.

219
00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:28.679
Namaste.

220
00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:31.593
Okay, first of all, mate,
thanks for sharing

221
00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.511
your unique perspective
on things.

222
00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.680
Again.

223
00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:37.416
But, just for now,
why don't you try on

224
00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.793
some positivity, eh?

225
00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.633
A little positivity
might go with that vest.

226
00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.989
Okay, fine.

227
00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:46.197
I'm positive you all
are going to get eaten.

228
00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:49.591
Hug time!
It is hug time.

229
00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:51.671
Hug time!

230
00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:53.800
Oh, that feels good.
Our hearts are synchronizing!

231
00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.190
I can squeeze you forever

232
00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:00.796
Someday,
when the Bergens find us...

233
00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.474
and the survival of every
Troll is in your hands...

234
00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:04.789
I sure hope the answer

235
00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:06.240
is singing, dancing,
and hugging...

236
00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:07.872
because that's all you know
how to do.

237
00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:11.191
That is not true!
Poppy can also scrapbook.

238
00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:14.113
I can't believe you're
gonna be queen one day.

239
00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:19.280
Tune out his
negative vibrations, Poppy.

240
00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.549
They're toxic.

241
00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.837
Some folks just
don't want to be happy.

242
00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:25.115
I guess.

243
00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.435
You guessed right.

244
00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:27.875
Boop.

245
00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:33.153
Yeah!

246
00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:40.391
Whoo! I love you so much!

247
00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:47.840
Yeah!

248
00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:49.878
Whoo! Glitter!

249
00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.872
YOLO!

250
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.274
More glitter!

251
00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:19.353
Turn it up!

252
00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:40.588
I can't hear you!

253
00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.472
Trolls.

254
00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.313
Okay, everyone.

255
00:14:48.480 --> 00:14:50.471
I just want to
take a moment...

256
00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.232
and get a little real.

257
00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:53.400
Poppy!

258
00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:55.152
She's my friend!
I know her!

259
00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:02.476
I'd like to take a second
to celebrate our king...

260
00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:03.560
my father...

261
00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:06.835
who, 20 years ago
this night...

262
00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.753
saved all of us
from those dreaded...

263
00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:17.508
Bergens.

264
00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:23.835
Gotcha.

265
00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:29.593
Uh...

266
00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:30.795
Cupcake?

267
00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:36.551
Run!

268
00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:37.640
Run! Run!

269
00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:39.440
Poppy, help!

270
